[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670078066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2670078066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2670078066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fJihy","user":{"login":"Kersoph","id":26461040,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph","html_url":"https://github.com/Kersoph","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kersoph/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T00:22:13Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T00:28:22Z","body":"At first sight in the [diff beta4 - beta5](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/93ac21cf8..2a347ab86), I only see a small [change around file_access_zip.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/93ac21cf8..2a347ab86#diff-ee1308bee418e6c2b2bfef9c75a037fc1f729745bc93cf8b89678f7a8879f7d1) \nBut would be weird if this is the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670078066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869653689","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2869653689","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2869653689,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rC3C5","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T09:30:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T09:30:17Z","body":"Bisected to [the cherry pick](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/63cecb78755d43126b9113153b8d8c1201a0280c) that originates from #91210, cc @Faless for context","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869653689/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911718882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2911718882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2911718882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tjU3i","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T08:53:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T08:53:20Z","body":"If I change the `get_position()` code to this, fascinatingly the not equal condition hits, with `pos` as 4, and `pos2` as 294. Not sure why yet.\n\n```\nuint64_t FileAccessZip::get_position() const {\n\tERR_FAIL_COND_V(!zfile, 0);\n\tZPOS64_T pos = unztell64(zfile);\n\toff_t pos2 = unztell(zfile);\n\t\n\tif (pos != pos2)\n\t\treturn pos;\n\t\n\treturn pos;\n}\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911718882/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911742875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2911742875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2911742875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tjaub","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T09:01:05Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T09:26:10Z","body":"* I wonder whether the problem is that the zip file has been created in a 32 bit format, but cannot be read with 64 bit format?\nThat maybe if this was created 64 bit format it would read ok. Seems unlikely but this bug is kind of strange. .. seems unlikely.\n\n* Another possibility. Perhaps we are mixing and matching 32 and 64 bit calls to minizip? The `total_out_64` and `total_out` seem to have got out of sync (these are the file pointers I believe).\n\nI wonder whether this bug also has been seen in 4.x.\n\nAlso intriguing:\n* The return type of `zuntell` seems to be signed (32 bit?)\n* The return type of `zuntell64` seems to be unsigned (64 bit)\n\n\n#### Zip within zip\nAh, just read you are reading a zip _within_ a zip, this is more suggestive of a shared variable in minizip that is breaking the operation. It may be an idea to try an MRP in 4.x, because I suspect it may occur there too, and we could get more eyes on it that way.\n\nIt is possible this is not officially supported (by minizip), it might be required to decompress the first zip to raw memory, then decompress the second zip from the unzipped version. But if this is the case it's amazing it worked before. 🤔 \n\nUPDATE: It seems to fail reading in the first zip with `_load_resource_pack()` rather than the 2nd.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911742875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911847775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2911847775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2911847775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tj0Vf","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T09:32:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T09:32:42Z","body":"This seems quite tricky to pin down and spending longer than I have this morning:\n\nI think for now if @Kersoph was able to try creating an MRP in 4.x that would be super useful.\n* If it doesn't occur in 4.x then we know there are related changes to find.\n* If it does, we can get more contributors looking at it.\n\nAlso, how much of a problem is this for you guys?\nWe can also consider reverting until we track this down (given that it hadn't caused a problem I'm guessing for Godot users previous to 3.6)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911847775/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912284639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2912284639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2912284639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tle_f","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T12:13:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T12:18:19Z","body":"> This seems quite tricky to pin down and spending longer than I have this morning:\n> \n> I think for now if [@Kersoph](https://github.com/Kersoph) was able to try creating an MRP in 4.x that would be super useful.\n> \n> * If it doesn't occur in 4.x then we know there are related changes to find.\n> * If it does, we can get more contributors looking at it.\n> \n> Also, how much of a problem is this for you guys? We can also consider reverting until we track this down (given that it hadn't caused a problem I'm guessing for Godot users previous to 3.6)?\n\nJust tested on 4.5 master and it does occur there too and reverting [this commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91210) makes it work again, so somehow something is being done differently between `unztell` and `unztell64`\n\n_Code for 4.5_\n\n```\nextends Control\n\nvar mod_pack_path = \"res://MyMod.zip\"\nvar mod_internal_data_path = \"res://MyMod/res.zip\"\nvar mod_texture_path = \"res://Icons/OK.png\"\n\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tvar mod_pack_path_loaded_successfully = ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack(\"res://MyMod.zip\", true)\n\tvar mod_internal_data_path_loaded_successfully = ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack(mod_internal_data_path, true)\n\t\n\tvar file = FileAccess.open(mod_texture_path, FileAccess.READ)\n\tvar file_buffer = file.get_buffer(file.get_length())\n\tfile.close()\n\tvar mod_image = Image.new()\n\tmod_image.load_png_from_buffer(file_buffer)\n\tvar texture = ImageTexture.new()\n\ttexture.create_from_image(mod_image) #,0\n\tget_node(\"TextureRect\").texture = texture\n\t\n\tvar mod_direct_data_path_loaded_successfully = ProjectSettings.load_resource_pack(\"res://res.zip\", true)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912284639/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912290870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2912290870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2912290870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tlgg2","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T12:15:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T12:15:37Z","body":"I'll mark this as 4.x to get more traction, thanks for testing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912290870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912392709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2912392709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2912392709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tl5YF","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T12:47:40Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T12:47:40Z","body":"CC @Faless - seems like this was introduced by #91210.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912392709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912464135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103054#issuecomment-2912464135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103054","id":2912464135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tmK0H","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T13:11:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T13:11:14Z","body":"Seems like `unzSeekCurrentFile` is not resetting the 64-bit offset, 4.x version work with this patch:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/thirdparty/minizip/unzip.c b/thirdparty/minizip/unzip.c\nindex 7e8a6ac2d3..3362ab0147 100644\n--- a/thirdparty/minizip/unzip.c\n+++ b/thirdparty/minizip/unzip.c\n@@ -1558,6 +1558,7 @@ extern int ZEXPORT unzSeekCurrentFile(unzFile file, int pos) {\n\n         pfile_in_zip_read_info->stream.avail_in = (uInt)0;\n         pfile_in_zip_read_info->stream.total_out = pos;\n+        pfile_in_zip_read_info->total_out_64 = pos;\n\n         return ZSEEK64(pfile_in_zip_read_info->z_filefunc,\n                        pfile_in_zip_read_info->filestream,\n@@ -1581,6 +1582,7 @@ extern int ZEXPORT unzSeekCurrentFile(unzFile file, int pos) {\n\n             pfile_in_zip_read_info->stream.avail_in = (uInt)0;\n             pfile_in_zip_read_info->stream.total_out = 0;\n+            pfile_in_zip_read_info->total_out_64 = pos;\n             pfile_in_zip_read_info->stream.next_in = 0;\n         }\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2912464135/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.c